---
args: {"concepts": "ReuseConcept[]", "profiles": "MaterialProfile[]", "needs": "FunctionalNeed[]", "prior": "ReuseExchangeBook", "events": "Evidence[]"}
returns: "ExchangeLeg[]"
---
Use only qualified concepts with current owner and recipient authority. Call establishConversionBasis(profile, need, events) before comparing unlike quantity units. Build a finite graph of adaptation, collection, storage and delivery prerequisites. Allocate exact residual quantities, keeping reservations and in-custody material unavailable to another package. A missing transport/storage capability, density basis or reservation receipt leaves a proposed leg blocked, not confirmed.
